<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Brent Kutzle</songwriter><songwriter>Jacob Kasher Hindlin</songwriter><songwriter>Kevin Fisher</songwriter><songwriter>Noel Zancanella</songwriter><songwriter>Ryan Tedder</songwriter><songwriter>Zach Skelton</songwriter></songwriters><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">近来 我如茫茫海域中的波涛般 迷失了方向</text><text for="L2">穿梭在七十亿的浪潮 学着去面对这一切</text><text for="L3">发射信号弹 我需要以爱与奉献</text><text for="L4">好换得那些我从未熟悉之人的信任</text><text for="L5">也许我该试着去找回从前的自己</text><text for="L6">带我去往熟悉的地点 面见熟悉的人</text><text for="L7">试图与你联系 想着也许你会告诉我</text><text for="L8">倘若这里真人来人往 我为何如此孤单？</text><text for="L9">我能否得到回应？</text><text for="L10">我能否 能否得到回应？</text><text for="L11">我能否得到回应？</text><text for="L12">我能否 能否得到回应？</text><text for="L13">真朋友 好朋友 向来难寻 面对这真相吧</text><text for="L14">买下完美的住所 却发现地下室漏水成灾</text><text for="L15">也赚得盆满钵满 现在我不会再去追逐利益</text><text for="L16">都是奥克拉荷马长大的孩子 朋友 我们可别虚度光阴</text><text for="L17">我不过是努力为自己描绘着美好蓝图</text><text for="L18">有些事也许再过40年我才会开始介意</text><text for="L19">我已准备就绪 亦有能力去编写自己的人生</text><text for="L20">因为这里人潮拥挤 都孤单无比</text><text for="L21">我能否得到回应？</text><text for="L22">我能否得到一丝回应？</text><text for="L23">我能否得到回应？</text><text for="L24">我究竟能否得到回应？</text><text for="L25">从自己的倒影中我已有所觉察</text><text for="L26">噢 我能否得到回应？</text><text for="L27">我究竟能否得到回应？</text><text for="L28">深感孤寂</text><text for="L29">此刻 我正转换至一条新的路途</text><text for="L30">脚踏实地 寻找着真实之物</text><text for="L31">有时 需要他人施以援手并不算什么丢脸的事</text><text for="L32">思绪飞向云端 说道</text><text for="L33">我能否得到一丝回应？</text><text for="L34">我究竟能否得到回应？</text><text for="L35">我能否得到一丝回应？</text><text for="L36">我究竟能否得到回应？</text><text for="L37">我能从自己的倒影中感觉到</text><text for="L38">噢 我能否得到回应？</text><text for="L39">我究竟能否得到回应？</text><text for="L40">试图找回曾经的自己 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(深感孤寂)</span></text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Connection"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="OneRepublic"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Connection - Single"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1401489355"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USUM71808832"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:05.505" end="2:17.295"><p begin="0:05.505" end="0:08.745" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:05.505" end="0:05.925">These</span> <span begin="0:05.925" end="0:06.255">days</span> <span begin="0:06.255" end="0:06.585">my</span> <span begin="0:06.585" end="0:07.005">waves</span> <span begin="0:07.005" end="0:07.305">get</span> <span begin="0:07.305" end="0:07.785">lost</span> <span begin="0:07.785" end="0:07.935">in</span> <span begin="0:07.935" end="0:08.085">the</span> <span begin="0:08.085" end="0:08.745">oceans</span></p><p begin="0:08.745" end="0:11.595" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:08.745" end="0:09.135">Seven</span> <span begin="0:09.135" end="0:09.465">billion</span> <span begin="0:09.465" end="0:09.855">swimmers,</span> <span begin="0:09.855" end="0:10.125">man</span> <span begin="0:10.125" end="0:10.215">I'm</span> <span begin="0:10.215" end="0:10.545">going</span> <span begin="0:10.545" end="0:10.725">through</span> <span begin="0:10.725" end="0:10.875">the</span> <span begin="0:10.875" end="0:11.595">motions</span></p><p begin="0:11.595" end="0:14.445" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:11.595" end="0:11.985">Sent</span> <span begin="0:11.985" end="0:12.225">up</span> <span begin="0:12.225" end="0:12.315">a</span> <span begin="0:12.315" end="0:12.675">flare,</span> <span begin="0:12.675" end="0:12.705">I</s